.Dd November 15, 2020
.Dt LED 4
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm led
.Nd Generic LED driver
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
framework exposes controllable LED's through a
.Xr sysctl 7
hw.led subtree.
A value of 1 means that the corresponding LED is lit, and a value of 0
means that it is unlit.
Writing a value of 1 will switch on the LED, and writing a value of 0
will switch it off.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr sysctl 7
.Sh HISTORY
The
.Nm
driver first appeared in
.Nx 9.0 .
.Sh AUTHORS
The
.Nm
driver was written by
.An Jared McNeill Aq Mt jmcneill@netbsd.org .
